# Quarterly report with a generated table of contents.
output = ARGV.len() > 0 ? ARGV[0] : "markdown-report-toc.docx"; let body = """---
title: Quarterly Impact Report
author: Cedar Harbor
subject: Q2 operating review
toc: true
numbering: true
page_numbers: true
---
# Quarterly Impact Report

This report summarizes the second quarter results for the Cedar Harbor customer platform.

## Highlights

- Revenue grew **18 percent** year over year.
- Support response time fell below one hour.
- Four hundred sixteen customers used the new workflow.

## Operating metrics

| Metric | Q1 | Q2 |
| :--- | ---: | ---: |
| Revenue | $108,000 | $128,000 |
| Customers | 382 | 416 |
| Median response | 1h 18m | 54m |

## Method

The finance and support teams reconciled the figures on July 5. The report uses the same definitions as the board dashboard.

{{pagebreak}}
## Next quarter

The team will prioritize self-service billing, onboarding instrumentation, and a regional support pilot.
""";
p=_lmcode_ cli="lmoffice docx" install="github:lmctl-ai/lmoffice@latest";
let d=docx.create(${output}); d.markdown(${body}).save();
end _lmcode_
savedsl(p,output+".dslb"); r=system(concat(dsl_cli(p),["--lmcode",output+".dslb"]),120000); assert(r.code==0);
